    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "177519747706da7a",
      "translationZh": "新的智能体运行框架不断涌现。哪些真的能处理 Office 文件？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e5d8ef743c35e2cf",
      "translationZh": "办公工作需要一份专门的检查清单。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f02352b707913dd5",
      "translationZh": "我目前会问这些问题：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1618d666cc88eadf",
      "translationZh": "文件模型——智能体是将工作簿、单元格区域、文档和幻灯片理解为对象，还是在编辑不透明的文件字节？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "18696a08fb0ca8e5",
      "translationZh": "确定性工作——公式和结构化操作能否在引擎中运行，而不是让模型计算所有内容？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "77ef7b732337763f",
      "translationZh": "保真度——交付物是否仍是真正可编辑的 Office 文件？漂亮的 HTML 预览，与一份别人可以继续编辑的 PPTX 并不是一回事。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cd32e3eeab0e55c9",
      "translationZh": "审查——在源文件被替换之前，你能否看到发生变更的对象、未通过的检查，以及尚未解决的决策事项？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf363c309cfb371e",
      "translationZh": "运行时——同一套底层 API 能否同时在浏览器和无界面的 Node 进程中工作？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
